<title>USA: Smart Choice Automotive to buy Angus Motors.</title>
<headline>Smart Choice Automotive to buy Angus Motors.</headline>
<dateline>TITUSVILLE, Fla. 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smart Choice Automotive Group Inc said Thursday it entered into a letter of intent to buy the privately held Angus Motors Inc of Cocoa, Fla.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>In 1996, Angus Motors had gross revenues of about $14.6 million, Smart Choice said.</p>
<p>Smart Choice said it plans to operate this location as a new car facility and used car superstore.</p>
<p>Smart Choice consolidates new and used car centers and finance companies.</p>
</text>
